#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Draw window frames using &titlebar colors"
msgstr "Lukis kerangka tetingkap guna warna papan &tajuk"

#: config.cpp:43
msgid ""
"When selected, the window borders are drawn using the titlebar colors; "
"otherwise, they are drawn using normal border colors."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dipilih, sempadan tetingkap akan dilukis menggunakan warna papan "
"tajuk; jika tidak, mereka akan dilukis menggunakan warna normal sempadan."

#: config.cpp:49
msgid "Draw &resize handle"
msgstr "&Lukis pengawal ulangsaiz"

#: config.cpp:51
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab handle\" in the bottom "
"right corner of the windows; otherwise, no grab handle is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Apabila dipilih, hiasan dilukis dengan \"kawalan pegang\" di sudut bawah "
"kanan tetingkap; jika tidak, tiada kawalan pegang dilukis."

#: config.cpp:56
msgid "Actions Settings"
msgstr "Tetapan Aksi"

#: config.cpp:58
msgid "Double click on menu button:"
msgstr "Dwi klik pada butang menu:"

#: config.cpp:60
msgid "Do Nothing"
msgstr "Tidak Buat Apa-apa"

#: config.cpp:61
msgid "Minimize Window"
msgstr "Minimakan Tetingkap"

#: config.cpp:62
msgid "Shade Window"
msgstr "Suram Tetingkap"

#: config.cpp:63
msgid "Close Window"
msgstr "Tutup Tetingkap"

#: config.cpp:66
msgid ""
"An action can be associated to a double click of the menu button. Leave it "
"to none if in doubt."
msgstr ""
"Aksi boleh di sepadankan dengan dwi klik butang menu. Tinggalkannya kepada "
"tiada jika ragu-ragu."
